# HP50g launch through the original UI and ARMToolbox.
# Copy HPCLANG.HP from SD to HOME, recall the native object from File Manager,
# return to the stack with HALT, then follow the hardware-verified library menu:
# RS+LIB exposes ARMTo on F1, and ARMTo exposes PrRUN on F1.
2000 chord lshift files
4200 capture files
4500 tap up
4800 tap f6
6500 capture sd
6900 tap enter
7200 tap down
7600 capture sd-payload
8000 tap f2
9200 capture copy-destination
9500 tap down
9800 tap f6
11600 capture copy-result
12100 tap f4
13400 capture recalled-in-filer
13800 tap nxt
14200 tap nxt
15000 capture filer-halt-menu
15400 tap f1
16700 capture payload-recalled
17200 chord rshift two
18450 capture lib
18800 tap f1
20100 capture armtoolbox
20200 host-mkdir ZZHPDIR
20500 tap f1
20800 monitor
